    <w:p w14:paraId="642EB80B" w14:textId="705E7CB2" w:rsidR="005D1318" w:rsidRDefault="003F53F3" w:rsidP="0049372A">
      <w:pPr>
        <w:pStyle w:val="Heading1"/>
      </w:pPr>
      <w:r>
        <w:rPr>
          <w:rFonts w:hint="eastAsia"/>
        </w:rPr>
        <w:t>B</w:t>
      </w:r>
      <w:r>
        <w:t>aidu Paid Search Video Style</w:t>
      </w:r>
      
    </w:p>
    <w:p w14:paraId="4EF2102D" w14:textId="3763608B" w:rsidR="003F53F3" w:rsidRDefault="003F53F3"/>
    <w:p w14:paraId="4DADD386" w14:textId="2408C44A" w:rsidR="00D9124B" w:rsidRDefault="003F53F3">
      <w:r>
        <w:t xml:space="preserve">Baidu supports video style for a pretty long time. However, paid search account owners rarely use this. Due to the rise of short video in China, </w:t>
      </w:r>
      
      
      <w:r>
        <w:rPr>
          <w:rFonts w:hint="eastAsia"/>
        </w:rPr>
        <w:t>B</w:t>
      </w:r>
      <w:r>
        <w:t>aidu paid search now focus more on video format on search ads ad well.</w:t>
      </w:r>
    </w:p>
    <w:p w14:paraId="4A3E4985" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D9124B" w:rsidRDefault="00D9124B"/>
    <w:p w14:paraId="73861C96" w14:textId="4AA68FC6" w:rsidR="00D9124B" w:rsidRDefault="00D9124B">
      <w:r>
        <w:t>From our recent experience, Baidu gives more opportunity to display video rather than its Big Image style. Also, the CTR is usually better than static image style. So, it is recommended to use video more nowadays.</w:t>
      </w:r>
      
      
    </w:p>
    <w:p w14:paraId="570D61C0" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D9124B" w:rsidRDefault="00D9124B"/>
    <w:p w14:paraId="21B5D935" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00D9124B" w:rsidRDefault="00D9124B">
      <w:r>
        <w:t>You can find this function under creative setting in the paid search account.</w:t>
      </w:r>
    </w:p>
    <w:p w14:paraId="7A7B984C" w14:textId="5ED62ABE" w:rsidR="003F53F3" w:rsidRDefault="00340355">
      <w:r>
        <w:t>Video style supports at account level. Under this setting, the video can be displayed any ads from your account.</w:t>
      </w:r>
    </w:p>
    <w:p w14:paraId="107B7E7B" w14:textId="32F38D28" w:rsidR="00340355" w:rsidRDefault="00340355">
      <w:r>
        <w:t>Video style also supports at account level. Under this setting, the video can be displayed as selected campaign. you can use different video for different campaigns.</w:t>
      </w:r>
      
      
      
      
      
    </w:p>
    <w:p w14:paraId="5046386A" w14:textId="1514426C" w:rsidR="00340355" w:rsidRDefault="00340355" w:rsidP="00340355">
      <w:r>
        <w:t>Video style also supports at ad group level. Under this setting, you can use different video for ad group.</w:t>
      </w:r>
      
      
      
      
      
      
    </w:p>
